76000	Flor Peach wine	Drink that will allow you to immediately regenerate your life points (HP) at 500 points. Nicht Handelbar.		
76001	Attribute reset	The application of this object makes it possible to redistribute your attributes, so you can develop your character in another way. Nicht Handelbar.		
76002	Reduced Head	This reduced demon head opens the seal to the third floor of the Devil's Catacumba. Nicht Handelbar.		
76003	Hurry potion	This potion reduces your skill load time by 20 percent for 30 minutes. Nicht Handelbar.		
76004	Elixir de la Luna (P)	Automatically fill your sp. Contains 10,000 sp. Nicht Handelbar.		
76005	Elixir de la Luna (m)	Automatically fill your sp. Contains 300 000 sp. Nicht Handelbar.		
76006	Compass for metins	The compass shows you the position and distance of the next method. The more shines, the closer you are. It can be activated 6 times. Nicht Handelbar.		
76007	Value layer	The ancient warriors exhibited their courage wearing a colorful layer with which they attracted the attention of the monsters. Nicht Handelbar.		
76008	Dragon Medal	It protects you from the loss of experience when you are revived. Nicht Handelbar.		
76009	Dragon parchment	Eliminate the risk of destroying an object if the improvement fails. Only quality is reduced. In addition, the probability of a successful improvement increases by 10%. Nicht Handelbar.		
76010	Blood stone	This stone made with the blood of Bahar-Tarajis guarantees entry into the grotto of exile. Nicht Handelbar.		
76011	Leader's book	While the group leader is equipped with this book, all group members will obtain 30% more experience points. Nicht Handelbar.		
76012	Speed ??potion	You upload your movement speed at 60 for 30 minutes. Nicht Handelbar.		
76013	Object of coercion (az.)	With some luck add a bonus to one of your Items (up to a maximum of 4 bonuses). Object of the level trunk, not tradeable.		
76014	Enchanted object (az.)	Eliminate bonds from one of your Items and add new. Object of the level trunk, not tradeable.		
76015	Ball blessing	A blessed legendary ball. If an object has 4 attributes, this ball adds another attribute. Object of the level trunk, not tradeable.		
76016	Parchment blessing	Eliminate the risk of destroying an object if the improvement fails. The cost of this is that quality is reduced by 1 point. Object of the level trunk, not tradeable.		
76017	Attack potion +10	Increase your attack speed by 10% for 30 minutes. Nicht Handelbar.		
76018	Attack potion +15	Increase your attack speed by 15 for 30 minutes. Nicht Handelbar.		
76019	Entrance ticket	If you show this entrance ticket to the respective guardian, you can access the next floor of the spiders's dungeon as well as the strength of the red dragon. Nicht Handelbar.		
